  "unit": "Player-season pairs, comparing performance before and after a team change.",
  "sample": "All players from the 2022-23 through 2025-26 NBA seasons who meet the following criteria: 1. Changed teams between two consecutive seasons. 2. Played at least 500 possessions in both the season before and the season after the team change. 3. Had at least 100 'cut' possessions and 100 'drive' possessions in the season prior to the team change. 4. Classified as 'cut-heavy' if their 'cut' possessions account for >X% of their total non-transition offensive possessions and 'drive-heavy' if their 'drive' possessions account for >Y% (thresholds X and Y to be determined based on data distribution to ensure sufficient sample sizes and clear distinction).",
  "power": "A power analysis will be conducted once the sample size of eligible players is determined. Given anticipated small sample sizes, the study will focus on effect size estimation and confidence intervals rather than solely p-values. If the sample size is critically low (e.g., <20 players per group), the study will pivot to a descriptive analysis of observed trends and individual player case studies.",
