  "falsification": "The primary hypothesis is that cut-heavy roles travel better. A falsification would involve finding no significant difference in portability, or that drive-heavy roles travel equally well or better. A secondary falsification would be if the classification of 'cut-heavy'/'drive-heavy' does not correlate with expected stylistic differences in play.",
