  "decision_rule": "The hypothesis will be considered supported if the confidence interval for the estimated difference in PPP change (cut-heavy vs drive-heavy) is positive and sufficiently far from zero (effect size determined a priori as meaningful, e.g., >0.05 PPP) with a p-value < 0.1 (due to expected small sample size challenges). Otherwise, it will be considered not supported or inconclusive.",
